{"title": "Swimmers Compete at Pan Pacific Championships; Records Set", "summary": "At the Pan Pacific Swimming Championships, Australian swimmer Lani Pallister won the women's 200-meter freestyle final, narrowly defeating Canadian Summer McIntosh. Pallister also competed against American Katie Ledecky in the 1500m freestyle. In other events, American Kate Douglass set a world record in the 50-meter freestyle preliminaries. Canadian swimmers achieved success, with Summer McIntosh winning gold in the 400 individual medley and Taylor Ruck winning silver in the 100 butterfly. The Canadian women's 4x200m freestyle relay team secured a bronze medal.", "summary_points": ["Lani Pallister won the women's 200m freestyle at the Pan Pacific Championships.", "Summer McIntosh finished second to Pallister in the 200m freestyle.", "Kate Douglass set a world record in the 50m freestyle preliminaries.", "Summer McIntosh also won the 400m individual medley.", "Canadian swimmers won bronze in the women's 4x200m freestyle relay."], "title_hi": "पैन पैसिफिक चैंपियनशिप में तैराकों ने भाग लिया; रिकॉर्ड बने", "summary_hi": "पैन पैसिफिक तैराकी चैंपियनशिप में, ऑस्ट्रेलियाई तैराक लानी पेलिस्टर ने महिलाओं की 200 मीटर फ्रीस्टाइल फाइनल जीता, जिसमें उन्होंने कनाडाई समर मैकइंटोश को मामूली अंतर से हराया। पेलिस्टर ने 1500 मीटर फ्रीस्टाइल में अमेरिकी केटी लेडेकी के खिलाफ भी प्रतिस्पर्धा की। अन्य स्पर्धाओं में, अमेरिकी केट डगलस ने 50 मीटर फ्रीस्टाइल की हीट में विश्व रिकॉर्ड बनाया। कनाडाई तैराकों ने भी सफलता हासिल की, जिसमें समर मैकइंटोश ने 400 मीटर व्यक्तिगत मेडले में स्वर्ण पदक जीता और टेलर रक ने 100 मीटर बटरफ्लाई में रजत पदक जीता। कनाडाई महिलाओं की 4x200 मीटर फ्रीस्टाइल रिले टीम ने कांस्य पदक हासिल किया।", "summary_points_hi": [], "framing": {"center": ["Emphasized Lani Pallister's victory over Summer McIntosh in the 200m freestyle, noting Pallister's win against her 'swimming idol'."]}, "framing_hi": {"center": ["लानी पेलिस्टर की समर मैकइंटोश पर 200 मीटर फ्रीस्टाइल में जीत पर जोर दिया, जिसमें पेलिस्टर की अपने 'तैराकी आदर्श' पर जीत का उल्लेख किया गया।"]}, "topic": "Sports", "region": "World", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://live-production.wcms.abc-cdn.net.au/301d9a6f6cbdecdc7cdc1d8a9899f777?impolicy=wcms_crop_resize&cropH=2813&cropW=5000&xPos=0&yPos=430&width=862&height=485", "sources": [{"source": "The Globe and Mail", "owner": "The Globe and Mail", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPcFRDcld4bTZlSW52RGsxOTVTRHZqREtaVl84RXEzVGk1aE5Nd09KdVRiM2QzZTBfVEw1X2doekl2SHNaeDdVSmMxVWFlcjRVVWMzOVJ4VU1keWNvYUs0NmhNUTRYcmppeWFiRUEtVVBEMEZnR0o0aFZXVnFLTDlKYzB1bFNtdW9uc3dLT2pSajdPblRKUmo2RGVSU1pMUUlwSTQtclBHd3dxekF4bTBWUE04VUJBUQ?oc=5", "headline": "McIntosh edged by Pallister in Pan Pacific 200-metre freestyle final"}, {"source": "ABC Australia", "owner": "ABC Australia", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.abc.net.au/news/2026-08-13/swimming-pallister-gold-silver-pan-pacific-championships/107034628", "headline": "Pallister downs McIntosh to claim 200m gold medal at Pan Pacs"}, {"source": "Reuters", "owner": "Reuters", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxORU1ERjJQU3d2NG9PWF9CNlBCOUJFaGFrTFFKUmJjdkExUFViMENQRFVtNkFzNml4T1NkbHE2bXZLVWUtLVE5bkJxWVc2d2U4MEU0cjlhUk5GSndEU3YtSFZQbnp0MFktQzZDbF9XM0lVRUlSbXdOdEdVRGg3cFIzdzJwaG0wRXc1RFdnaF9lZGt4MDV5ZmxYNXBlWU1KMjBOeENURkxGWXoyS19KNU5XNmlRaFJVUQ?oc=5", "headline": "Pallister edges McIntosh at Pan Pacific Championship in 'first taste' of LA28 Games"}, {"source": "Reuters", "owner": "Reuters", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxQU1BlSGFXWG1hTFpsdzlFc3VPbW1PN0pzU1hZNmZrd0lkdWtVQlpHUHZ4ZzMtRERZTzRMdXZLaXI0OEZfb2xPZmhpcTNyczV1YkIwU012ZXBreUpDNlBhNjBMSGhPWHpVNC1oU21yN2JkWGVWSGFjejFPb3JrYnBvNnVSaDNtWkl2amlqRTExdlBOajMzVXJzVGJGRTR2NXdzWDJlbGNUU3dOWUFWZlVjdm5KMEg?oc=5", "headline": "McIntosh wins 400 individual medley after frustr